      "updated": 1751945141918,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements: \n- There are multiple instance of the service. \n- There are such multiple service.\n- we want to make a common system that will return the unique id\n  across the service. S1 id shouldn't match with s2, its kind of\n  global unique id generator.\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- low latency and high qps.\n- highly available. and consistency. ( consistency > availability. ) \n- alerts and monitoring.\n- fault tolerant and reliable.\n- it should be continue infinitely  \n\n\nEstimations: \n- QPS -> 1M+ qps.\n\n\nApi Design: \n\n/api/v1/id        POST\nRequest: {request_meta: {app_name,....}}\nResponse: { unique_id: <> }\n\nor can also be library.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements: \n- There are multiple instance of the service. \n- There are such multiple service.\n- we want to make a common system that will return the unique id\n  across the service. S1 id shouldn't match with s2, its kind of\n  global unique id generator.\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- low latency and high qps.\n- highly available. and consistency. ( consistency > availability. ) \n- alerts and monitoring.\n- fault tolerant and reliable.\n- it should be continue infinitely  \n\n\nEstimations: \n- QPS -> 1M+ qps.\n\n\nApi Design: \n\n/api/v1/id        POST\nRequest: {request_meta: {app_name,....}}\nResponse: { unique_id: <> }\n\nor can also be library.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dLl2lZJ5raBcVZC8-cVHY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1220.010433239039,
      "y": -1625.803821513652,
      "width": 677.7596435546875,
      "height": 2450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
